            "sid": "NEH 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngosuku lwamatshumi amabili lane lwaleyonyanga abakoIsrayeli babuthanela ukuzila ukudla, begqoke izambatho zokulila, begcwele uthuli emakhanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AbakoIsrayeli bazahlukanisa labo bonke abezizweni, bema bavuma izono zabo lobubi babokhokho babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bema endaweni yabo, bafunda ugwalo lomlayo weNkosi uNkulunkulu wabo okwama‐awa amathathu; bavuma izono zabo okwama‐awa amathathu futhi bekhonza iNkosi uNkulunkulu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ethaleni lamaLevi kwakumi oJeshuwa loBani loKadimiyeli loShebaniya loBuni loSherebiya loBani loKenani; bamemeza ngelizwi elikhulu eNkosini uNkulunkulu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasekusithi amaLevi oJeshuwa loKadimiyeli loBani loHashabineya loSherebiya loHodiya loShebaniya loPethahiya bathi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
